  "finalText": "### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **CSV Record Termination at EOF (`src/csv.mjs`)**:\n   - Updated `parseCsv` so that when EOF is reached while a record was actively started (`recordStarted`) or ended with a closed quote (`state === 'closed'`), `endRecord()` is invoked to commit the final record. This properly retains records ending without a trailing newline (including trailing empty fields and quoted fields) without introducing phantom records on files that already end with newlines.\n\n2. **Half-Cent Decimal Rounding (`src/money.mjs`)**:\n   - Replaced floating-point multiplication (`Math.round(Number(text) * 100)`) in `parseMoney` with exact integer arithmetic using `BigInt`. Decomposes the number into integer units of $1/10000$ (with up to 4 fractional digits padded to 4 decimal places) and computes `(totalUnits + 50n) / 100n` multiplied by the parsed sign. This performs symmetric round half away from zero for positive amounts and negative credit notes without floating-point drift.\n\n3. **Vendor-Scoped Invoice Identity (`src/dedupe.mjs`)**:\n   - Updated `invoiceKey` to serialize `[invoice.vendorId, invoice.invoiceId]` (matching `invoiceFingerprint` vendor scoping and payment routing logic) so invoices sharing the same invoice identifier across distinct suppliers do not conflict and both are accepted and indexed properly.\n\n---\n\n### Commands Run and Results\n\n1. **Baseline reproduction**:\n   - `node --test test/*.test.mjs`\n   - *Result*: 6 test failures (`actual mixed-feed CLI output...`, `CSV EOF is a valid record boundary...`, `invoice identity includes vendor...`, `rounding at a half cent...`, `mixed supplier feed retains the EOF row...`, and `same invoice number in different suppliers...`).\n\n2. **Test suite verification**:\n   - `node --test` & `node --test test/*.test.mjs`\n   - *Result*: All 44 tests passed across all test files with 0 failures.\n\n3. **CLI execution and JSON inspection**:\n   - `node bin/ledger.mjs import data/invoices.csv --payments data/payments.csv --as-of 2026-03-01 --format json`\n   - *Result*: Exited with code 0. Successfully parsed all 4 invoices across the 3 vendors (`vendor-a`, `vendor-b`, `vendor-c`), rounded half-cent amounts to exact cents (`1.01`, `10.08`, `-1.01`, `2.00`), correctly routed and applied all 3 payments, and reported zero diagnostics or unapplied payments.",
